  "instructions": [
    "mix gochujang, brown sugar, sesame oil, green onions, and toasted sesame seeds in a small bowl.",
    "warm the corn husk wrap by wrapping it in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "spread a thin layer of the gochujang mixture on the center of the corn husk wrap.",
    "place 6 oz of smoked salmon on top of the gochujang mixture.",
    "add 1/4 cup of kimchi on top of the salmon.",
    "sprinkle crushed ginger and black pepper over the kimchi.",
    "drizzle lemon juice and water over the top.",
    "fold the bottom half of the corn husk wrap up over the filling, then fold in the sides and roll up the wrap to form a tight cylinder.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!"
